            <ArticleTitle>A case report: caring for a golden retriever with nasal cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>689-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cvsm.2011.03.016</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article is a case report of a veterinarian caring for a golden retriever with nasal cancer. It addresses the 5-step strategy for comprehensive palliative and hospice care protocol, which organizes examinations, consultations, and conversations with clients. The case report presents diagnosis, treatment, and euthanasia.</AbstractText>
